OL,5,G1450 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FDella and John welcome their
OL,7,     Frivals to the pet-friendly Dog in
OL,8,     Fa Doublet in Peterborough. Phil
OL,9,     Fand Sharon find something unusual
OL,10,     Fin their loo, while Lowrie bonds
OL,11,     Fwith Gordon the pig.
OL,12,G1520 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FPhil and Sharon hope to impress
OL,14,     Ftheir guests with their added
OL,15,     Fextras at The Torcroft Boutique
OL,16,     FB&B in Torquay. A spot of sailing
OL,17,     Fblows away the tension, but the
OL,18,     Fgloves come off at breakfast.
