OL,5,G1550 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FMark and Lowrie host the last
OL,7,     Fvisit, at the 600-year-old
OL,8,     FRhydspence Inn in Herefordshire.
OL,9,     FThe medieval character charms the
OL,10,     Fguests, but some of the
OL,11,     Fpracticalities prove painful.
OL,12,G1620 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FIt's the final day of the
OL,14,     Fcompetition and the B&Bers meet
OL,15,     Ffor the last time. There are
OL,16,     Ftears, recriminations and
OL,17,     Faccusations as the payments are
OL,18,     Frevealed and the winner is
OL,19,     Fannounced.
