OL,5,G1850 The Dog House Australia
OL,6,     FThe Prestia family must decide
OL,7,     Fwhether to take on a bonded pair
OL,8,     Fof dogs. And retired nuns Margaret
OL,9,     Fand Antoinette hope to find their
OL,10,     Fdog companion.
OL,11,G1955 The Dog House
OL,12,     FPuppies Poppy and Fizz struggle to
OL,13,     Fadapt to kennel life and may need
OL,14,     Fto be separated if they hope to be
OL,15,     Fre-homed. And is Moose the Staffy
OL,16,     Fmore dog than most families can
OL,17,     Fhandle?
